ojban to logic right if we haven't worked out the other direction, because =
only then can we be sure that Lojban has incorporated all the clues needed.=
  In the examples here, some of the shifts are very secondary, but deprenex=
ification is surely essential (and dangerous, as you say, though this case =
is Ok apparently) and so is this sort of collapse.  The Principia to Polish=
 shift and the logical moves are just dressing.

